" class=\"nav-takeover-link\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"nav-takeover-link\" href=\"/services\">Services</a></li><li><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"nav-takeover-link\" href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a></li><li><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"nav-takeover-link\" href=\"/gallery\">Gallery</a></li><li><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-current=\"page\" class=\"nav-takeover-link active\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"nav-takeover-link\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li><li><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"nav-takeover-link\" href=\"/shop\">Shirts</a></li></ul><div class=\"nav-takeover-cta mt-9 flex justify-center\"><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/instant-experiences/widget/1231797?instant_experiences_enabled=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-display inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-[2px] bg-cream px-8 py-3 text-xl tracking-tight text-forest-deep transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105\">Book Now<span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens <!-- -->Booksy<!-- --> in a new tab)</span></a></div></nav><div class=\"nav-takeover-footer flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 pt-3 text-cream/70\"><a href=\"https://instagram.com/tedishairstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"mono-micro text-[13px] transition-colors hover:text-neon\">Instagram ↗</a><span class=\"text-cream/30\">·</span><a href=\"tel:+17329477359\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"mono-micro text-[13px] transition-colors hover:text-neon\">(732) 947-7359</a></div></div><main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><div class=\"pb-14 md:pb-20 lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"px-6 pt-24 md:px-12 lg:px-20 lg:pt-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] gap-x-16 gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] lg:items-start lg:gap-y-6\"><div class=\"order-1 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-1\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><h1 class=\"display-xl italic lg:text-[clamp(72px,7vw,112px)]\">Meet Tedi.</h1></div></div><div class=\"order-2 lg:col-start-2 lg:row-start-1 lg:row-span-2 lg:-mt-4 lg:h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"mono-micro mb-3 text-stone-500\">Tedi, outside the studio @ Bellazio Collective</p><div class=\"hairline relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden lg:aspect-auto lg:h-[calc(100svh-15rem)] lg:min-h-[560px] lg:max-h-[700px]\"><img alt=\"Tedi standing outside the studio at Bellazio Collective\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-[center_80%]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/professional-images/tedi-door.jpg\"/></div></div><div class=\"order-3 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex max-w-[620px] flex-col gap-6 text-xl leading-[1.7] text-stone-700 lg:gap-5 lg:text-xl lg:leading-[1.6]\"><p class=\"first-letter:font-display first-letter:float-left first-letter:mr-3 first-letter:text-7xl first-letter:leading-[0.8] first-letter:text-ink\">Tedi&#x27;s Hair Studio is a private barber studio inside Bellazio Collective in Matawan, NJ.</p><p>Tedi offers haircuts, fades, shape ups, and beard trims in a relaxed, single-chair space. Every appointment is one-on-one, with time to talk through what you want and attention to the details that make your cut feel right.</p><p>Whether you&#x27;re keeping your usual look or trying something new, you&#x27;ll get personal attention from start to finish. Appointment only. Book through Booksy.</p></div><blockquote class=\"mt-10 border-l-2 border-forest pl-6 font-display text-2xl leading-snug tracking-tight italic lg:mt-6 lg:text-xl\">“<!-- -->Come as a client, leave as a regular.<!-- -->”<footer class=\"eyebrow mt-4 text-stone-500 not-italic\">- Tedi</footer></blockquote></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 bg-forest px-6 pt-12 pb-10 text-cream md:px-12 md:pb-24 md:pt-16 lg:mt-40 lg:px-20 lg:pb-32 lg:pt-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><h2 class=\"heading-1\">A look inside the studio.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><figure><div class=\"hairline-cream relative aspect-square overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"The collection\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.04]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/professional-images/pops.jpg\"/></div><figcaption class=\"mt-4\"><p class=\"font-display text-lg tracking-tight\">The collection</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-cream/60\">Collectibles, framed pieces, and studio milestones.</p></figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><figure><div class=\"hairline-cream relative aspect-square overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"The studio wall\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.04]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/professional-images/gbjerseys.jpg\"/></div><figcaption class=\"mt-4\"><p class=\"font-display text-lg tracking-tight\">The studio wall</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-cream/60\">Ft. 2026 Finals MVP Jalen Brunson&#x27;s signed jersey.</p></figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><figure><div class=\"hairline-cream relative aspect-square overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"The whole space\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.04]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/professional-images/chair-wash.jpg\"/></div><figcaption class=\"mt-4\"><p class=\"font-display text-lg tracking-tight\">The whole space</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-cream/60\">One chair, one room, and everything organized.</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative px-6 pt-14 md:px-12 md:pt-20 lg:px-20 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 hidden -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 lg:block\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" class=\"bear-mask shrink-0 text-forest\" style=\"width:260px;height:260px\"></span></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1440px] flex-col items-start gap-7 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between lg:gap-10\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-stone-500\">Licensed &amp; Certified</p><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-700\">NJ State Board licensed. The certificate is<br/>displayed in the studio.</p></div><div class=\"self-end lg:self-auto\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-[2px] border border-transparent bg-forest px-9 py-4 text-base font-medium tracking-wide text-cream transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:translate-x-0.5 hover:border-forest hover:bg-cream hover:text-forest\" href=\"/services\">View all services<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\">→</span></a></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-[80] flex items-center justify-center bg-forest\" style=\"transform:none\"><div class=\"text-cream\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.92)\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" class=\"bear-mask shrink-0 text-cream\" style=\"width:340px;height:340px\"></span></div></div></main><footer class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-forest-deep text-cream\"><